<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras ADR held as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras ADR held as buy.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings has maintained its buy recommendation on Telebras' ADR, which it said showed significant upside despite strong price performance.</p>
<p>Patrick Jurczak, head of ING's Latin American telecom research, said in a report that Telebras' 12-month price target is $175 to $200 per ADR, showing a potential price appreciation of up to 25 percent from today's price of $159.58.</p>
<p>(--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414)</p>
</text>
